        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia nawe agateebhia Isaya iga, “Ëng'ana yö ÖMÖNENE kebhörë ögëgambërë mbuuya.” Naagambërë igo kugira naaitegerreeyë iga, “Igankë yange köbha igo, hano wanyoore ömörembe nu ubhuriihi mbibha ho guchinsikö chö öbhögambi bhoone.”",
          "type": "text",
